WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:31.568
It was a bright morning in the park.

2
00:00:31.569 --> 00:00:37.838
Kip wanted to play with Bird.

3
00:00:37.839 --> 00:00:46.711
But she was away looking for worms.

4
00:00:46.712 --> 00:00:54.505
"I'm bored," said Kip.

5
00:00:54.506 --> 00:01:01.092
"I have nobody to play with.

6
00:01:01.093 --> 00:01:05.180
Maybe I'll collect acorns," said Kip.

7
00:01:05.181 --> 00:01:17.518
Kip did that for a little while.

8
00:01:17.519 --> 00:01:21.919
Soon he was bored again.

9
00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:36.302
"What else can I look for?" wondered Kip.

10
00:01:36.303 --> 00:01:48.985
Kip found a rusty can.

11
00:01:48.986 --> 00:02:05.083
He found an old shoe.

12
00:02:05.084 --> 00:02:08.330
And he found a slimy banana peel.

13
00:02:08.331 --> 00:02:16.569
"Yuck," said Kip.

14
00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:21.289
Then Kip found something very strange . . .

15
00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:27.307
Kip found a person!

16
00:02:27.308 --> 00:02:30.449
But this was not a big person.

17
00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:36.435
It was a small person.

18
00:02:36.436 --> 00:02:39.523
She was as small as Kip.

19
00:02:39.524 --> 00:02:45.415
"Hi," said Kip. "My name is Kip.

20
00:02:45.416 --> 00:02:47.614
What's your name?"

21
00:02:47.615 --> 00:02:50.172
The person didn't answer.

22
00:02:50.173 --> 00:02:57.869
She didn't say anything at all.

23
00:02:57.870 --> 00:03:06.894
"Hmm," said Kip. "Why don't you talk?"
